  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for Code 128 from PDF is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan Code 128 barcode from PDF in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode Code 128 data message from PDF file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
